    "created_at": "2023-05-11T21:45:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-05-11T21:45:31Z",
    "body": "Ah I see. If you did unfortunately have multiple elements with the same id then you get `HTMLCollection` not `Element`. Seems quite easy for a reasonable developer to avoid that as well as avoid accessing those other fields. \r\n\r\nI'll move this to the HTML repo, thanks!",
